# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# IMPORTANT: this rule is ONLY applied when no static file matches. The prerender
# step writes dist/one-ring/index.html, dist/envy/index.html, etc. — those static
# files are served first, so crawlers (Discord, Google, Twitter) see per-route
# meta. Only genuinely unknown paths fall through to the homepage shell for
# client-side routing.
/*    /index.html   200
